WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:07.008
Hi! Welcome to your first German lesson!

2
00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:12.744
Today you learn: What's your name? Where are you from?

3
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:18.905
We greet. In the morning we say:

4
00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:21.521
Good morning!

5
00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.521
During the day we say:

6
00:00:24.921 --> 00:00:27.137
Good day!

7
00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:30.137
In the evening we say:

8
00:00:30.537 --> 00:00:32.849
Good evening!

9
00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:35.777
And before going to sleep:

10
00:00:36.177 --> 00:00:38.321
Good night!

11
00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:44.217
And this always works, especially with friends:

12
00:00:44.617 --> 00:00:46.689
Hi!

13
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.200
What's your name? Listen:

14
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.056
My name is Lena.

15
00:00:55.456 --> 00:01:00.144
Ich heiße… That's how you say your name.

16
00:01:00.544 --> 00:01:03.000
Or very short:

17
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.592
I'm Lena.

18
00:01:05.992 --> 00:01:10.008
Ich bin… That's easy!

19
00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.620
Where are you from? Listen:

20
00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.836
I'm from Colombia.

21
00:01:19.236 --> 00:01:24.212
The verb is kommen (to come). Look at the ending:

22
00:01:24.612 --> 00:01:26.684
I come

23
00:01:27.084 --> 00:01:29.156
you come

24
00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.652
you come (formal)

25
00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:38.367
Friends, family, children: we say du.

26
00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:40.863
What's your name?

27
00:01:41.263 --> 00:01:46.431
Teacher, boss, strangers: we say Sie.

28
00:01:46.831 --> 00:01:49.143
What's your name? (formal)

29
00:01:49.543 --> 00:01:55.335
Not sure? Say Sie. It's polite.

30
00:01:57.033 --> 00:02:01.577
Listen: Lena and Mateo in German class.

31
00:02:01.977 --> 00:02:07.577
Hi! I'm Lena. What's your name?

32
00:02:07.977 --> 00:02:10.409
My name is Mateo.

33
00:02:10.809 --> 00:02:13.025
Where are you from?

34
00:02:13.425 --> 00:02:17.753
I'm from Colombia. And you?

35
00:02:18.153 --> 00:02:22.433
I'm from Austria. Bye!

36
00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:31.005
Now you! Say out loud: What's your name? Where are you from?

37
00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.836
Great! Now you can:

38
00:02:42.236 --> 00:02:52.324
You can greet. You can say: My name is… I'm from… Now do the exercises!

39
00:02:52.724 --> 00:02:54.844
See you soon!
